PENDING_CHANGES.md

# 内置第三方扩展：只归档运行所需文件，开发文件与 source map 不入库
sillytavern/public/scripts/extensions/third-party/*/.git-vendored/
sillytavern/public/scripts/extensions/third-party/*/.github/
sillytavern/public/scripts/extensions/third-party/*/.vscode/
sillytavern/public/scripts/extensions/third-party/*/@types/
sillytavern/public/scripts/extensions/third-party/*/docs/
